:relationship_name_contains_entity_name_supply_chain_phase_entity_description_a_reusable_template_for_defining_a_physical_supply_chain_phase_across_materials_and_project_instances._a_valid_phase_must_have_a_physical_state_a_transformation_or_custody_change_and_a_measurable_output._phase_mapping_preserves_explicit_links_between_metrics_units_sources_and_custodians.
